          "title": "Dataset accompanying PRL publication on quantum-enhanced quickest change detection of transmission loss",
          "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.17460928",
          "publication_date": "2025-10-28",
          "description": "This data is intended for public release with the Physical Review Letters article with arxiv identifier 2503.12276/quant-ph\nDescription of the uploaded data:\n\n\nprl_fig3_data: data in ASCII format for Fig 3 in the published paper, which can be loaded by MATLAB cmd \"load prl_fig3_data\"\n\n\nprl_fig7_data: data in ASCII format for Fig 7 in the published paper, which can be loaded by MATLAB cmd \"load prl_fig7_data\"\n\n\nprl_supplem_fig4b_data: data in ASCII format for Supplemental Material Fig 4b, which can be loaded by MATLAB cmd \"load prl_supplem_fig4b_data\"\n\n\nplot_PRL_figs.m: MATLAB / Octave file. If we run this command then it will issue the above load commands and some appropriate plot commands to create 3 PNG files for the figures, if one wants. \n\n\nWe have also included the 3 generated PNG files.\n\n",
